window.DEVLOG.agents["d3_kit"] = {"name": "Car kit & assembly", "role": "Wheels/tyres/brakes by tier, wings, scoops, blowers, exhausts, paragon dressings, Car3D API", "status": "done", "progress": 100, "current": "Fix round 2 done: vented flattened chute (2.4 m, darker inside, 8 tube shroud lines + riser, 7.2 m back on the centre line at roof height), opponent plates, smeared tyre swap at full blur (no lettering ghost), 16 m headlight beam at 0.5", "done": ["shared car viewer: src/render/three/dev/cars.html (http://localhost:5173/src/render/three/dev/cars.html?body=muscle&view=34 (my 9508 server is stopped for cool mode))", "wheels by tier (single-material tyre atlas: sidewall lettering + tread bump; no groove geometry): stock eco tyre + slotted hubcap cover; street 10-spoke alloy; sport split 5-spoke deep dish w/ polished lip, slotted discs, 4-pot; pro = Weld-style drag wheels w/ beadlock, white-letter DRAGZILLA slicks rear + skinnies front (drag), or forged cross-spoke mesh + R-comp + drilled discs + 6-pot (super/hyper/wedge w/o pro susp); accent calipers w/ logo; motion-blur discs", "LOD per 4-wheel set: high 16-24k, medium 9-12k, low 7-9k tris; wheels = 5 spin draws + caliper (+logo at high)", "add-ons: ducktail lip, pedestal wing, big drag wing, swan-neck (+ paragon hoop/ACR/SVJ), hood bulge/cowl/scoop/shaker(animated)/ITB stacks/louvres/turbo/blower(animated belt), FMIC, exhaust stock/single/dual burnt-Ti/quad/side pipes/triple/centre, NOS bottles + braided line, splitter/canards/skirts/diffuser, carbon hood (mesh named hood, else conformal shell), wheelie bar (stays on the ground in wheelies), chute pack", "8 paragons: style overrides (kit/style.ts) + Look livery + small 3D touches (Civique vortex gens, Viperion fender gills, Lamberghoul side intakes)", "perf: mergeStatic() bakes body + kit into one mesh per material after paint (keeps livery hook + light toggles); sanitize() kills degenerate tris / zero normals (they were NaN -> bloom blobs); 1 dynamic light per car at high, none below"], "todo": [], "notes": "VIEWER: http://localhost:5173/src/render/three/dev/cars.html?body=<body>&tier=stock|street|sport|pro&paragon=<brand>&view=34|r34|side|front|rear|top|wheel|wheelr|low|hood|under&lights=1&dyn=full&quality=low|medium|high&floor=matte&hud=0 ; window.__viewer.stats() -> {tris, wheels, body, draws}. API: buildCar3D(spec, {quality, lights:\"auto\"|\"none\"|\"full\"}) -> KitCar3D (extends Car3D): wheels[], brakeDiscs[] (one per-car material), setBrakeGlow(0..1), wheelCentre(i), exhaustCount, exhaustWorld(i), exhaustDirWorld(i,out), rearContactWorld, wheelieBarWorld(out) (sparks), setEngine(rpm01), tyreRadius{front,rear}, sprung, axles. setSteer(+ = left, toward -Z). build.paintMeshes/tail/headLightMeshes are re-pointed to the merged meshes after assembly. TO core/show: use quality \"medium\" for the far/ghost car. TO carsA/B/C: bodies are the bulk now (muscle ~52-58k, tuner ~80k, sedan ~84k at high); the kit adds ~20k (wheels) + 1-5k. Any degenerate triangles are now harmless after merge (normals sanitized). POLISH: the bar loop over the tuner and wedge front mouths is in the BODY (present at tier=stock too), not the kit -> carsC. Shader hitches: every kit material exists from build; toggles are intensity/opacity only; light count per car is fixed at build (lights opt). Call car.prewarm(renderer, camera, scene) once after adding the car (core: before the countdown). ROUND1 API: car.setChute(k) (0 clears, 1 = blown; grows ~0.3 s, trails ~4.8 m on a damped spring w/ flutter; hasChute), call setChute(0) on reset; wheelieBarWorld(out) returns null unless the bar wheels touch (wheelie >= 3.2 deg); blur keys on |spin*dt| so pass the slow-mo dt to car.update; setHeadlights(true) also shows a ground beam (q>=medium). prewarm() compiles chute + beams too. ROUND2: specFromVisual(v, {plate}) + exported plateFor(name) (world: pass plateFor(opponent.name) for the ghost; default derives a plate from the opponent colours). Chute lines/vent never cast shadows (avoids an instanced depth program compiling at the finish).", "etaMinutes": 0, "updated": "2026-10-24T10:04:09Z"};
